data.real-time-transcription#Real-time Transc:
Configure voice activity detection for word-by-word transcription:
const streamId = await client.ai.openTranscriptionStream(
  "Whisper",
  (text) => console.log("Word:", text),
  {
    startThreshold: 0.25,
    startWindow: 100,
    endThreshold: 0.15,
    endWindow: 100,
